WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:06,630
How could she really be your granddaughter, right? Come and see us off.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,180
Don't touch her

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,500
she is still a child

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,710
She is only three and a half years old. Stop, Ms. Lu.

5
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:17,470
I have to talk to you about this. How can you look at me as a human being?

6
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,950
Why did I forget you two were here?

7
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:27,470
There is no need to invite these two distinguished guests to leave too.

8
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,630
Let's go by ourselves

9
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,830
She is worthy of being the richest woman

10
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:33,790
This is too authoritative, right? Don’t say hard words and don’t do soft things.

11
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:35,270
Absolutely awesome

12
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:37,110
Such a powerful woman like Ciying

13
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:39,030
In front of her, a tough guy like Grandpa Lu

14
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:41,350
They all look like delicate little cowards.

15
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:50,320
There is probably no one in the whole world who can live with her. Oh my god.

16
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:54,740
Whose baby is so discerning?

17
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,140
It turns out he belongs to our family.
